        "AttributionNote": "The Complete Book of the Five Lamps, volumes 34–120 (五燈全書(第34卷-第120卷)), Xuefeng Sihui section. Xuefeng Sihui is the exact hall speaker who compares Yaoshan's sparse appearances with contemporary incessant questioning and says the former was somewhat closer.",
